top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8F%B6%E5%B0%BC%E5%A1%9E\" title=\"小叶尼塞\"><img alt=\"小叶尼塞\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8F%B6%E5%B0%BC%E5%A1%9E\" title=\"小叶尼塞\">小叶尼塞</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>保利斯塔纳热浪</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：308203</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3082/308203/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一个陈旧的玻璃瓶，有明显使用痕迹。<br />记录：取自春汛时期的奥卡河，每当这个时候，水中的话语繁多而绵密。即使把全身浸没在水中，也无法得出明确的指向……过量地倾听容易引发谵妄与混乱。<br /><br />一个崭新的陶罐，瓶口装饰有马拉若岛常见的纹样。<br />记录：取自马拉诺北部。通往马拉诺的路途曲折而有趣。穿行在遮天蔽日的森林中，有许多新奇的生物，譬如鲜艳的鹦鹉，拥有巨大喙部的鸟类，和成群结队的水牛……这里的活水总能给出清晰的指向，通过它们，很容易令人想到一些热烈而喧闹的事物。在圣彼得堡，这是很少见的。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"308203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/42/Belonging-308204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">热带羽毛发圈<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Tropical Feather Hairband</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>被遗忘在旅行箱角落的普通发圈，还未褪色的羽毛仿佛裹挟着一缕炙热的气息。虽然受访者没有追赶时髦的习惯，但深思熟虑后做出的决定，往往能带给她不错的结果。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/97/Belonging-308205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">苏库里风情\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">流苏小披肩</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sucuriú River Shawl</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2.5<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以低垂的茂密枝叶为设计灵感的流苏披肩，在阳光照耀下缓缓流淌着微妙的光泽。摊开它，就像摊开一页记录斑斓夏日的诗篇。<br />既然漂荡于世界最清澈的苏库里河之上，便没有人会留心鉴赏衣着时尚。好在受访者并不在意，毕竟她只是为水而来。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/17/Belonging-308206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">纯净之源<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Essence of the Sucuriú</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>来自苏库里河最深处的河段，一抹澄澈的温热湛蓝。<br />亚马逊的靛色河湾清透纯净，是最为合适的占卜场所，也是难得一见的异国风光。再三思忖后，受访者决定只是悉心收起这份源泉，然后用自己的双眼铭记这段美好旅程。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 蓝河湾1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 蓝河湾2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%93%9D%E6%B2%B3%E6%B9%BE2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">蓝河湾 <small style=\"color: grey\">Around the Riverbend</small></span></span>"}}